    {
      "type": "fieldframe:text",
      "text": "**Fluid armor** carries effect fluids. Every **pair** of fluids you wear, including a fluid with itself, grants one effect. Strength grows with the amount: `10 × √(buckets A × buckets B)`. Three fluids give six effects. Some effects are harmful, so choose your mix."
    },
