    {
      "type": "fieldframe:text",
      "text": "Fill armor with an **Armor Infuser** module. Bind its lane to the armor and its reservoir to an effect fluid; it uses 2 RF per mB. Effect fluids are made in a **Mixer**:\n- Liquid Coal: coal + lava.\n- Blazing Resin: blaze powder + lava.\n- Gelid Cryotheum: snowballs + water.\n- Arcane Mix: lapis + water.\n- Resonant Ender: an ender pearl + water.\n- Redstone Flux: redstone + water.\n- Energized Glowstone: glowstone dust + water."
